  "uuid": "942ba30d-7e06-4188-985a-858d6e9bd731",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "77dcfb02-caa7-86b4-0ca2-4a871637fdbf",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "eb78b029-c1f9-6296-051e-eded88436a2d",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Some of the students had the following to say as their experience over the past week (29th July to 2nd August 2019) of orientation:",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I have learned so much in the last four days in information technology, a very important key lesson in my career progression, it has been a hard task to do but I appreciate the progress because I am not where I began. I appreciate the fact that I joined Aga- Khan University for I am in the right place and in the right hands\". (Stella)",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"It has been quite challenging but at the same time the most exciting encounter with technology. In the past I have not been a friend to my computer except for preparing presentations, receiving and responding to official mails. Now I am struggling but I appreciate the immense support of my facilitators who are extremely patient to guide me through my learning experience. Each day begun with a lot of frustration navigating through the \"bread crumps\" but ended with new knowledge and new skills. I have made a choice to hang in there until I become an expert, hopefully I will be back to give you my story as I graduate \". (Kato)",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"My experience with this session is that it was exciting and challenging at the same time. It has enabled me to see things in a different perspective and increase my knowledge on information technology. I really appreciate the application of technology in learning\". (Susan)",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"Have learnt that with technology i can manage my studies anywhere\" (Kenneth)",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"My experience of Moodling, VLE , Google docs, Menti, stories telling, survey monkey, Breadcrumbs, forums, world cloud, google drive and Zoom at 10pm outside the session was quite a mazing and inspiration\" (Peter)",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "In conclusion, most freshmen through quick survey preferred to be taught through blended learning taking into considerations both interactive face-to-face session and online learning as shown:",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
